/tools/pipeline/skate2port/work/
/tools/pipeline/scratch/
/out/
# Test screenshots of the running game (they show retail art); the four core-menu-*.png were committed earlier.
/crates/skate-game/*.png

# Release review 10-18 (legal): the retail disc folder and retail menu screenshots never publish.
/Skate 3 (USA*/
/crates/skate-game/core-menu-*.png

# Skate 2 physics: data made from the user's disc never publishes, and the port builds in its own target folder.
/private/
/vendor/skate2-rust-port/target/

# Agent and editor leftovers: tool folders, shortcuts, temp files and patch backups never publish.
.claude/
.impeccable/
*.lnk
*.tmp
*.orig
# Vendored crates keep crates.io's Cargo.toml.orig.
!/vendor/**/Cargo.toml.orig
# A private agent handoff note (it names local paths).
/AUDIO_HANDOFF.md
# Story-mode research scratch (scripts with local paths, not part of the build).
/docs/superpowers/specs/skate3-story-mode-reference/work/

# AI-written notes (investigations, handoffs, plans, audits) stay on this PC and never publish.
# Any new Markdown file anywhere is ignored. The published guides are listed below, so a fresh clone has them too;
